  "description": "Canonical KEY_ALIASES registry for biofool_secrets (issue CloudManagement#129). 'aliases' are same-credential alternate spellings safe in every repo. 'project_aliases' apply only when the consuming repo selects itself via BIOFOOL_SECRETS_PROJECT or resolve_secret(project=...).",
  "notes": {
    "CLOUDFLARE_EMAIL_API_TOKEN": "Deliberately NOT aliased to CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN: the generic token lacks the Email Sending:Edit permission, so alias fallback would silently pick a key that 403s.",
    "GCP_PROJECT_ID": "WorldStudioFinder-scoped: interchangeable there, but globally a repo may point the two vars at different projects \u2014 kept out of the global section.",
    "GOOGLE_API_KEY": "Semantically unsafe to alias globally. In AIRichardMoon/VigilentSupport it resolves to GSM id 'coaching-gemini-api-key'; in WorldStudioFinder it is interchangeable with MOVEMENT_ARTS_GOOGLE_API_KEY/HOBBY_LOBBY_GOOGLE_API_KEY; in story_graph it is a Gemini/AI-Studio key that must NOT satisfy Knowledge-Graph/Geocoding lookups (HTTP 400/403 verified 2026-09) \u2014 those resolve via MOVEMENT_ARTS_GOOGLE_API_KEY only.",
    "coaching-*": "GSM secret ids inside project quantum-aikido-coaching, not env-var spellings \u2014 valid only for AIRichardMoon lineage (VigilentSupport carries a vendored copy)."
  },
